@IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5035

GET {{IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
### Get all issues
GET {{IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress}}/Issues/
Accept: application/json


### Delete a issue
DELETE {{IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress}}/Issues/
Accept: application/json


### Add a issue
POST {{IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress}}/Issues/
Accept: application/json


### Update a issue
PUT {{IssueTrackerApp.Server_HostAddress}}/Issues/
Accept: application/json

